        {
          "id": 1628646181,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Thanks! I see the `.mailmap` file, but I can't see where it's used. [`generate_authors.py`](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/tools/generate_authors.py) doesn't use or mention any sort of map.\n\nAlso, this process should probably be documented somewhere. I'm happy to do that as part of this MR if someone can clarify how many of the following steps are expected of the contributor vs. handled by core devs:\n\n1. Updating `.mailmap`\n2. Running `tools/generate_authors.py`\n3. Pushing the updated `AUTHORS`",
          "author": {
            "id": 6020526,
